      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":269.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"51"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":184.0,"y":327.0},"guid":"4bc9e0ad-707c-442c-9505-09e8c5fb883a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3350"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":431.0,"y":350.0},"guid":"697d8510-7727-4fbf-9b08-04ee07d3aae5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"3352"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["name"],"member":{"name":"Find","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-113.0,"y":695.0},"guid":"cc42bff5-edd5-4d98-92d7-20e7701ece54","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"3354"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-266.0,"y":272.0},"guid":"f1949f03-01a2-4605-92f4-fca1bf8a47f4","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3358"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":583.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"292374a0-066a-4322-ba68-cf3f455d1f68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"3360"},{"member":{"name":"currentTrumpColor","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"DeckManager","targetTypeName":"DeckManager","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":1460.0,"y":789.0},"guid":"5479e2ec-48d7-4908-8dd3-a99ae4d0e651","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"3362"},{"type":"System.Int32","valu