      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"f5564143-9dc1-4951-a5aa-4ed789e65492","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":835.0,"y":400.0},"guid":"c6171e65-79b5-4828-822c-a560b880fb09","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"3367"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-424.0},"guid":"7653cf62-f2d5-4a81-865e-0e3150880fc0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"6660"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[{"key":"In","label":"In","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"controlOutputDefinitions":[{"key":"Out","label":"Out","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"PlayerHuman","summary":null,"pan":{"x":-291.548,"y":-4.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-858.0,"y":-21.0},"guid":"076136f3-de80-432a-8a55-ca3fbb8c7aa4","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphInput","$id":"6674"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-281.0,"y":-22.0},"guid":"6b1359c2-142d-4d6b-b986-9082ab324ce7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphOutput","$id":"6676"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[{"key":"In","label":"In","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"controlOutputDefinitions":[{"key":"Out","label":"Out","summary":null,"hideLabel":false}],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"EnableCardMovement","summary":null,"pan":{"x":69.57422,"y":75.6545},"zoom":0.9,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-309.0,"y":-30.0},"guid":"ad2b1b38-f12f-4242-b416-4b66e82d54f7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScriptin